      "updated": 1795162935509,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Your errorMiddleware is the single place that formats errors.\nRoute handler below builds its own 404 response instead of\nthrowing. Rewrite it so the error goes through the global handler.\n\na) What response does the global handler send if a plain\n    Error('boom') (no statusCode) reaches it?\nb) Why is returning a 404 locally inconsistent with the rest of the app?",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Your errorMiddleware is the single place that formats errors.\nRoute handler below builds its own 404 response instead of\nthrowing. Rewrite it so the error goes through the global handler.\n\na) What response does the global handler send if a plain\n    Error('boom') (no statusCode) reaches it?\nb) Why is returning a 404 locally inconsistent with the rest of the app?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "a4"
    },
